[bold]Intents[/] [dim]6[/]
  act         [dim]bundled[/]                         Act on the open items of a unit: resolve what you can,
                                              and propose the replies it needs as drafts for you to
                                              approve
  address     [dim]bundled[/]                         Triage the reviews and failing checks of a pull
                                              request you develop, in its workspace
  ask-author  [dim]intents/ask-author/intent.toml[/]  Ask the author one question
  nudge       [dim]bundled[/]                         Ask whoever the pull request waits on for the next
                                              step, in a comment; guidance is the topic
  probe       [dim]bundled[/]                         Check that an agent home can read its turn, record it,
                                              take an answer and be resumed
  review      [dim]bundled[/]                         Start or continue a review round on someone else's
                                              pull request, in a dedicated workspace

[bold]Blocks[/] [dim]5[/]
  [bold]address[/]  organization=acme/kind=fix/intent=address.md  [dim]organization acme, kind fix[/]
  [bold]nudge[/]    user=ana/intent=nudge.md                      [dim]user ana[/]
  [bold]review[/]   intent=review.md                              [dim]every pull request[/]
           organization=acme/intent=review.md            [dim]organization acme[/]
           organization=acme/repo=api/intent=review.md   [dim]organization acme, repo api, paths **/*.sql[/]

~: 5 block(s), [green]no errors[/]
